          "lenses": ["6B.6", "6B.10"],
          "best_source_or_query_direction": "WHO, UNICEF, Rosstat, and Ministry of Health series with 2022 time stamps.",
          "why_it_matters": "These indicators are central to whether welfare conditions truly improved or merely stayed high on inherited systems."
        }
      ],
      "reason": "The dossier is fair as broad context, but it still leans heavily on baseline indicators and external analyses. It needs more direct 2022 delivery evidence and subnational detail."
    },
