          "why_it_matters": "The chapter needs to distinguish isolated falsehoods from a durable pattern of deception and correction."
        },
        {
          "gap": "Appointment evidence showing favoritism or competence choices in 2022 is still thin.",
          "lenses": ["7B.5", "7B.6"],
          "best_source_or_query_direction": "Personnel decrees and investigative coverage of who was promoted, protected, or shielded in Putin's circle during 2022.",
          "why_it_matters": "This would sharpen whether the package shows personal integrity failures or mainly system-level repression."
        }
      ],
      "reason": "The package is strong on public falsehoods, retaliation against anti-corruption scrutiny, and elite-network patronage, but direct personal-asset proof and cleaner personal-nexus evidence are still thin."
